                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gray to Mr. Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-05-01"><hi rendition="#italic">May 1, 1894</hi></date>.
                        (Received May 10.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 284.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: In sequence to my No. 275, of the 16th
                    ultimo, I beg to inclose copies of additional correspondence in regard to the
                    discriminating duties levied by the Mexican Government on American vessels.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Isaac P. Gray.</hi></signed></closer>






